o?t=1436","https://youtu.be/t4n9MAP2_14?t=2085","https://youtu.be/UTE0dNIv8nY?t=837"]},{"field":"reb","text":"Davis takes some rebound chances. Blocks stay at the base (about 1.7), close to the experts' 1.9, because he is still the better rim protector.","sources":["https://youtu.be/uarqbNA2dFk?t=894","https://youtu.be/t4n9MAP2_14?t=2096"]},{"field":"games_out","text":"He is recovering from a foot fracture, but the notes call him likely ready for opening night.","sources":["https://youtu.be/4gw4W4RTolY?t=80"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}